PapinhoAccelerator Server
Usage:
  papacc_server.exe --help
  papacc_server.exe config validate|diff|apply --source <file>
  papacc_server.exe config show-effective
  Configuration: offline validation only; CURRENT/apply unavailable
  papacc_server.exe service install|start|stop|status|remove
  papacc_server.exe service startup automatic|manual
  papacc_server.exe service install --prepare-lab --installation <directory> --configuration <relative-file>
  Service hosting is optional; install uses a virtual account, no password.
  Service mutations remain denied until installation and admission are qualified.
  papacc_server.exe --list-interfaces
  papacc_server.exe --port <port> --all-interfaces [--listener-profile legacy-endpoint] [--log-level <level>]
  papacc_server.exe --port <port> --interface-id <id> [--interface-id <id> ...] [--listener-profile legacy-endpoint] [--log-level <level>]
  papacc_server.exe --port <port> <bind-option> --listener-profile secure-principal --security-configuration-ref <reference> [--allow-network-egress --egress-policy-ref <reference> --egress-profile-ref <reference> --outbound-tls-profile-ref <reference>] [--log-level <level>]
Secure Principal lab source environment:
  PAPACC_SECURITY_CONFIGURATION_REF
  PAPACC_SERVER_CERTIFICATE_DER_B64
  PAPACC_SERVER_PRIVATE_KEY_PKCS8_DER_B64
  PAPACC_CLIENT_CA_DER_B64
  PAPACC_ALLOWED_CLIENT_CERT_SHA256
Log levels: off, error, warn, info (default), debug, trace
  off disables all PAPACC_LOGGER output
Example: papacc_server.exe --port 39999 --all-interfaces --log-level info
